          "text": "Description: Between September 24 and 29, 1983, several witnesses reported seeing in the sky a circular object about 50 cm in diameter emitting a yellowish light and rays of varying lengths. One witness, who was able to observe with a telescope, reported noticing a dark core surrounded by a bright ring. This is likely an astronomical observation. However, we lack elements to confirm this hypothesis.",
